essing scale variation in computer vision tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'SSH': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method used for object detection, specifically for small objects, mentioned in the context of addressing scale variation in computer vision tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'MS-CNN': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method used for object detection, specifically for small objects, mentioned in the context of addressing scale variation in computer vision tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'SNIP': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method that proposes advanced and efficient data argumentation methods to illustrate the scale variation problem.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'SNIPER': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method that proposes advanced and efficient data argumentation methods to illustrate the scale variation problem.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Dilated/Atrous Convolutions': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A type of convolution used to increase the resolution of the feature map, particularly useful for detecting small objects.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'RoIAlign': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method used to extract features from regions of interest (RoIs) with improved spatial accuracy.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'PoseTrack dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for training and evaluating pose estimation and tracking tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'COCO dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for evaluating the pose estimation performance of FastPose.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'MPII dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset utilized for training the pose estimation task.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'SSM dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A person Re-ID dataset used for training and evaluating MTN.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'PRW dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A 